# fixtures/hex/store-f/cs.1.hex: the changeset segment of store F's bulk commit f2 on import/1 ([F09 §16.4],
# [F06 §9]): row #3 as created, a note whose body the import found dropped. Its BLAKE3-128 stands in BLOBTAB as
# a dropped BlobRef (file = off = len = raw_len = 0, [F09 §6.3]; spec sync 3, S3-R-5): a bulk commit streamed
# with its import's own drop seals no such body and writes the dropped entry ([F09 §16.4] "Dropped bodies").
# Values fixed at append (rev_seq, created_tx, updated_tx 0; last_op_lsn 2^64 - 1), PREV 0, no store-level
# section; base_seq, from_lsn, upto_lsn and rt_upto_lsn 0 ([F09 §2.3]). Its number is the Reserve's (log.1 g5).

